            "description": "Buys new proxies. **Charges immediately.**\n\n- `country`, `city`, `isp` (required): use the values `GET /proxies` returns (`Singapore`, `Singapore`, `Mobile`).\n- `planType` (required): `DAY`, `WEEK` or `MONTH`.\n- `bandwidth_gb`: one of the tiers `GET /proxies` lists (200, 500, 1000). Default: the cheapest.\n- `quantity`: default 1.\n- `username` (`user:pass`, letters and digits) **or** `ipAddress` (IP whitelist), not both.\n- `couponCode`: optional.\n\nIf some units can't be provisioned, the response says how many were created and refunds the rest to account credit.",
